# VoodBuilder — GrapesJS / editor code

- **Never patch** `node_modules/grapesjs` or other Editor npm packages — lost on `npm update`
- Keep upstream GrapesJS **vanilla**; pin version in host/root `package.json` (semver range, not `*`)
- Custom behaviour only in:
  - `resources/js/editor/` — bootstrap, plugins, UI, traits
  - `resources/css/editor/` — chrome / block-preview styles
  - `src/Support/Editor/` — PHP blocks, preview HTML, render pipeline
- Extend via public APIs: `grapesjs.init` options, `editor.on`, `DomComponents.addType`, `VoodbuilderEditor.registerPlugin`
- After GrapesJS upgrade: smoke-test `?edit=1` (blocks, traits, save/reload) — see `docs/EDITOR.md`
- Companions ship their own `resources/js/editor/plugin.js`; do not merge paid UI into core
